# ==============================================================================
# Git Ignore Configuration for Liver Histopathology Research (HistoSAM-LoRA)
# Enforces: Security, Data Confidentiality, and GitHub File Size Limits (<100MB)
# ==============================================================================

# --- Confidential Medical / Primary Data (Do NOT Leak to GitHub) ---
# Raw tissue TIFF slides, patient data, and processed tiles
data/liver_primary/
data/public_pretrain/
data/splits/
*.tif
*.tiff
*.svs
*.ndpi
*.mrxs
*.npy
*.npz

# --- Large Model Weights & Checkpoints (Exceeds GitHub 100MB Limit) ---
